ence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.2 Theorem 1.2.2(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"17–18"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>38</span><span>39</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>合流、唯一正规形、正规形性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a8a21c46a8bd06a8\" href=\"?note=a8a21c46a8bd06a8\" title=\"56-df-unique-normal-form\">56-df-unique-normal-form</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"be6965f1baddcbdb\" href=\"?note=be6965f1baddcbdb\" title=\"56-df-normal-form-property\">56-df-normal-form-property</a>；可转换性峰化见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fd3a63cb1c046574\" href=\"?note=fd3a63cb1c046574\" title=\"56-thm-church-rosser-equivalence\">56-thm-church-rosser-equivalence</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NFProp}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NFProp}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NFProp}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{UN}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NFProp}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{UN}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UN}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{UNRed}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UN}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{UNRed}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核对陈述并复核推导：与正规形可转换的项由Church–Rosser有共同后继，正规形没有非零后继，故该共同后继就是该正规形。两个可转换正规形因此相等。共同源可达的两个正规形可转换，得到UNRed；不声称反向成立。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-unique-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"a8a21c46a8bd06a8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unique-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form-property","status":"resolved","id":"be6965f1baddcbdb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-church-rosser-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"fd3a63cb1c046574","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-church-rosser-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df